Data license

The derived data in data/ and docs/ is made available under the Open Database
License (ODbL) v1.0. It combines:

- the text of Philippine Republic Acts, which as works of the Government of the
  Philippines are not subject to copyright (Intellectual Property Code, Sec. 176),
  as published by the LawPhil Project and the Chan Robles Virtual Law Library;
- House bill records from BetterGov's open-congress-data (CC0);
- election winners from OpenHalalan (Leung et al. 2026, ODbL);
- towns, former names and census populations from the Philippine Internal
  Migration Dataset (ODbL, built from Philippine Statistics Authority sources);
- DepEd's school enrolment files and PhilHealth's list of accredited hospitals;
- PSA 2023 boundaries via faeldon/philippines-json-maps.
